This module implements the Microsoft Graph Connectors (custom Copilot
connector) gRPC contracts. The `.proto` files under `src/main/proto/Contracts/`
are copied from:

  https://github.com/microsoft/Custom-Copilot-Connector-using-Connector-SDK

and remain Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation, licensed under the MIT License.
The Java package option is the only local addition; the proto package, import
paths, and message shapes are unchanged so Graph Connector Agent (GCA) can
talk to this process on the published wire.

